  "id": "thecherrypit",
  "neon": "#ff2a5a",
  "note": "THE CHERRY PIT, on the corner of Cinder Lane and Filament Street. The room description is the brief: a windowless block painted arterial red, a padded vinyl door, and a pink neon cherry that has lost its stem and half its lower curve. It's a roadside strip club: a one-storey hall with a taller stage house behind it, a low sign fascia across the street face, and the loud part on a pole sign at the mouth of the side lot.\n\nThe street face, left to right: LIVE GIRLS on the corner, a queue of four posts and a sagging rope, and a steel porch with a barred cage door, a speakeasy hatch, a doorman's stool and a red awning with one end torn and hanging. XXX is over the porch and a pink tube runs along the top of the fascia. The pole carries the cherry and the name in a cabinet, and under it a black changeable-letter board: ALL NUDE / AMAT UR NITE / NO COVER B4 9, with the E gone. The name is on the pole and nowhere else.\n\nThe side lot (+x) is tarmac gone to gravel under one sodium lamp. The stage door is at the back of it with crates to sit on and a bulb over it, the skip is against the back, and a rusted fire stair climbs the flank to the roof hatch. Two blacked-out slots and a tag are on that flank as well.\n\n⚠ NO BRICK. `ty_cherry` and `ty_cherry_dk` are in PLAIN_WALL. In BRICK_WALL the hall read as tidy brickwork, and STUCCO's GPU relief reads as brick from the street too. The paint is flat and the grime parts do the weathering.\n\n⚠ NO WINDOWS, AND THE KIT IS TOLD SO. `KIT_DECLINE.strip` shuts the kit's `wall` section (it glazed the hall), its `signRoof` (a NIGHTCLUB hoarding repeating the cherry) and its `stair`.\n\n⚠ LIVE GIRLS IS ON THE LEFT CORNER ON PURPOSE. A free corner on the fascia gets the kit's 夜總會 trade blade, which would say the trade a fourth time.\n\n⚠ ON A FLANK (`face: 'x'`) A PART'S `cx` RUNS FRONT TO BACK THE OTHER WAY: on the +x flank a positive `cx` is toward the back. The stage door is at cx 0.22 for that reason.\n\n⚠ EVERY NEON PIECE IS ANCHORED 0.03 BEHIND ITS BACKING. neonArt bends its tubes 0.036 proud of the plane its `cy` names, so a `cy` on the backing's face floated the cherry clear of a cabinet 0.032 deep. Anchored 0.03 back, the tubes sit 0.006 off the board.\n\n⚠ THE LETTERBOARD IS BLACK WITH LIGHT LETTERS. A light board washed its own dark letters out at night.",
  "pal": "ty_cherry",
  "replaces": "strip",
